# Generated from tools/pharmbench/results/ by generate_leaderboard.py, and
# authored solely by .github/workflows/site.yml at build time. Deliberately not
# tracked: a committed copy goes stale the moment a submission merges, and a
# stale board invites contributors to regenerate it in their PR -- which #18
# forbids, because concurrent PRs collide on it and later merges drop earlier
# entries. Run the generator before rendering the site locally.
